WEBVTT

00:05:29.651 --> 00:05:34.825
bending its abdomen
and inserting a single egg

00:05:34.849 --> 00:05:36.956
into the body fluids of the aphid.

00:05:37.638 --> 00:05:39.795
By the way, the aphid tries to escape.

00:05:39.819 --> 00:05:44.078
She kicks and bites
and secretes different liquids,

00:05:44.102 --> 00:05:46.152
but nothing will happen, in fact --

00:05:46.176 --> 00:05:49.586
only the egg of the parasitoid
will be inserted

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.748
into the body fluids of the aphid.

00:05:51.772 --> 00:05:54.708
And after a few days,
depending upon temperature,

00:05:54.732 --> 00:05:56.149
the egg will hatch

00:05:56.173 --> 00:06:01.144
and the larva of this parasite
will eat the aphid from the inside.